      "message": "\u003e For pKVM\u0027s memory, it has struct pkvm_page, and its state and owner are stored in struct pkvm_page rather than PTEs, so we can still use pkvm_pgtable_unmap() to unmap and then use set_host_mem_pgstate to fix the state/owner?\n\nYeah, good point.",
